    "generated_on": "2026-11-10",
    "sha256": "e54247380492c7d610f2f5fd9ac606b30890190ed54b277727af004a9bbd4b51",
    "scribe": "Plant-based diets are the only truly ethical and healthy way to eat, and all other diets harm the environment and animals",
