    "scribe": "Parents should stop their children from eating any sugary or processed foods to protect their long-term health",
    "normalized_match": true,
    "reused": false,
    "verified": true
  },
  {
    "path": "ingles/preintermedio-1/audio/unit3/healthy-opinions/statement-3.mp3",
    "text": "If the government really cared about people's health, they would ban cigarettes and alcohol completely.",
